data: {"id": "11df44e597a743b7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1532", "run_id": "11df44e597a743b7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v16/workload`，UID `12605456-2339-4da9-9d4d-5523d1196b72`\n- **节点**: `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.33`，单容器 `app`\n- **当前状态**: phase=Running，但 Ready=False（ContainersNotReady）\n\n### 支持候选原因（NotReady 由探针配置错误导致）的强证据\n\n1. **Readiness Probe 探针配置与容器实际监听端口不一致**（核心证据）：\n   - 容器启动日志 `listening on 18080` 表明应用实际监听 **端口 18080**。\n   - Readiness probe 配置为 `http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready`，探测目标端口为 **18081**。\n   - 事件记录 `dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused`，确认", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789389480585, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

